<name>Heater &amp; Air Conditioner/Ventilation</name>
<section id="1002K_S000B" variety="S000B">
<name>Air Conditioner</name>
<ttl id="1002K_S000B_74X3N_T00G3" variety="T00G3">
<name>Cooler Compressor Assembly (Engine Model 2GR-FE)</name>
<para id="RM000000NBN00GX" category="G" type-id="3001K" name-id="522IS-00" from="200708">
<name>Component Inspection</name>
<subpara id="RM000000NBN00GX_01" type-id="01" category="01">
<s-1 id="RM000000NBN00GX_01_0001" proc-id="RM0550J___0000CY000000">
<ptxt>Inspect Cooler Compressor w/ Magnetic Clutch Assembly</ptxt>
<content1 releasenbr="1">
<s2>
<ptxt>Lock Sensor Resistance Inspection</ptxt>
<s3>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), measure the resistance between terminals 1 (SSR+) and 2 (SSR-) of the connector.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="E034870J08" width="2.775699831in" height="1.771723296in"/>
</figure>
<spec>
<title>Standard</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt>400Ω</ptxt>
</specitem>
</spec>
</s3>
</s2>
<s2>
<ptxt>Solenoid Resistance Inspection</ptxt>
<s3>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), inspect the resistance between terminals 2 (SOL+) and 1 (SOL-) of the connector.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="E103261J09" width="2.775699831in" height="1.771723296in"/>
</figure>
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09083-00170</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<spec>
<title>Standard</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt>10.6 ±0.5 Ω (compressor internal temperature 25°C)</ptxt>
</specitem>
</spec>
</s3>
</s2>
<s2>
<ptxt>Magnetic Clutch Operation Inspection</ptxt>
<s3>
<ptxt>Check that when the battery positive is connected to terminal 3 (MG+) of the connector and the battery negative is connected to the ground wire, an operating sound is heard and the magnetic clutch hub and rotor lock.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="E034870J09" width="2.775699831in" height="1.771723296in"/>
</figure>
</s3>
</s2>
</content1>
</s-1>
</subpara>
</para>
</ttl>
</section>
</servcat>
</pub>
